      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CINDY'S SECRET (1) is a last start placegetter in a Mix 2/3, jumping from this box and finishing a neck away in second over 318m at this track. Goes very well from this same draw winning two races. Can find winning form here. ADA TARO (8) in the money last time at this track (18.42) in a NG, finishing a 1.75 lengths second. Can hit the frame with the right run. MADAM ZELDA (6) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 7th at Wentworth Park following on from a third place finish (18.64) at this track the start prior. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Should be in this for a long way. PINK MILK (3) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
